      "title": "PACECareer Services",
      "description": "PACE Center Career Services | Saint Mary's College Skip to main content Visit Apply Give Search Submit Admission & Aid Visit Campus Apply to Saint Mary's Transfer Students Financial Aid Accepted Students Outcomes Academics Academic Programs Study Abroad Academic Calendar Course Catalog Graduate Studies Accelerated Bachelor's to Master's Programs Student Life Housing & Dining Campus Safety Student Resources Division for Belonging Parent Resources Prism for Parents Student Financial Services Spiritual Life Center for Faith, Action, and Ministry Center for the Study of Spirituality Holy Cross Education Campus Liturgy Schedule Alumnae The Bridge Reunion Alumnae Resources Career Services for Life Avenues The College Magazine Athletics Varsity Sports Club Sports Saint Mary's Intramurals Angela Athletic & Wellness Complex Ways to Give Impact of Giving How to Give Give Now Gift Planning Quick Resources Commencement Office of the President News & Stories Events Venue Rentals Camps Visit Apply Give Students Your Career Awaits Exploring Interests and Majors Jobs and Internships Graduate and Professional School Post-Graduate Service Outcomes Make an Appointment Saint Mary's Student Portal Parents and Family Preparing Students for Life Outcomes Alumnae Career Services for Life A Network of Empowered Women Recruit Saint Mary's Students Make an Appointment Employers Why Recruit Saint Mary's Students? Post Your Jobs and Internships PACE Career Services Welcome to the PACE Center Career Services The Prikkel Advising, Career, and Experience (PACE) Center is Saint Mary’s new home for advising, career development, and experiential learning.  Through the PACE Center's Career Services office, formerly known as Career Crossings Office (CCO), undergraduate and graduate students will find comprehensive career preparation that helps students and alumnae to build meaningful, successful lives. Discover Your Path Jobs/Internships Make an Appointment Meet the Team PACE Center Career Services Leads to Success PACE Center Career Services helps Saint Mary’s undergraduate and graduate students launch rewarding and fulfilling careers. From landing a position at a Fortune 500 company to securing a coveted role at Reddit, here are a few of the inspiring stories showcasing the diverse opportunities Saint Mary’s College students have gone on to with the help of our dedicated career counselors. 100 % of our graduates complete at least one internship or professional preparation experience. 94 % of graduates are employed full-time, earning a graduate degree, or involved in other full-time endeavors within one year of graduation. View More Success Stories Stay Connected With PACE Center Career Services facebook instagram instagram PACE Center Career Services 126 Le Mans Hall PACE Center Notre Dame, IN 46556-5001 (574) 284-4775 career@saintmarys.edu Office Hours Our offices are open each weekday from 8 a.m. to 5 p.m. ET To make an appointment, click here . Career Chat Mondays:  2 - 4 p.m. ET Wednesdays:  10 a.m. - 12 p.m. ET Thursdays:  2 - 4 p.m. ET Saint Mary's College Notre Dame, IN 46556 (574) 284-4000 A-Z Academic Programs Apply Contact SMC Cushwa-Leighton Library Give to Saint Mary's Human Resources Privacy Policy My Saint Mary's - Portal Shaheen Bookstore Visit Campus © 2026 Saint Mary's College. All Rights Reserved. facebook instagram youtube"
